Everyone,

I have posted updates for RRPP on Github.  Installing RRPP from github via devtools,

devtools::install_github(“mlcollyer/RRPP”)

will be the fastest way to update RRPP and avoid the issue discussed earlier.  Version 0.5.1 will be sent to CRAN shortly, and hopefully available from CRAN in a few days.

Warm regards,
Mike

